Package: homelab-pgbouncer-exporter
Architecture: all
Depends: prometheus-pgbouncer-exporter, pgbouncer, openssl
Recommends: homelab-agent, homelab-node-exporter
Description: PgBouncer metrics exporter wiring for the homelab-* ecosystem
 Wraps the Ubuntu-archive prometheus-pgbouncer-exporter for the fleet DB
 host. On configure it provisions a pgbouncer-only stats user (plaintext in
 the root:postgres userlist), a dedicated conf.d include adding
 stats_users + ignore_startup_parameters=extra_float_digits (required by
 the exporter's pq driver), reloads pgbouncer gracefully (SIGHUP, no
 dropped connections), writes the exporter connection string and advertises
 the exporter (kind: metrics-exporter, :9127) for homelab-prometheus to
 discover. Install on the PgBouncer host.
